Modified TimesFM derivative
----------------------------

The following files contain a translation and modification of the official
TimesFM Python/PyTorch implementation into native R/torch:

  R/arch-timesfm.R
  R/timesfm-feasibility.R
  R/timesfm-inference.R
  R/timesfm-module.R
  R/timesfm-state.R

Original work: TimesFM
Copyright 2025 Google LLC
License: Apache License, Version 2.0
Source: https://github.com/google-research/timesfm
Pinned source revision: 3dae50b20d7a724981e8ea36cda75578f80dd2dc

The files above were translated from Python/PyTorch to R/torch and modified for
R tensor conventions, checkpoint loading, engine contracts, device handling,
batching, and package integration. They carry prominent modification notices.
The complete Apache License, Version 2.0 is distributed in
LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt. The pinned upstream source contains no NOTICE file.

The numerical reference files under tests/testthat/fixtures/timesfm/ were
generated from the pinned official TimesFM implementation and checkpoint. They
are distributed as upstream-derived test material under the same Apache-2.0
terms. The fixture generator, input definitions, and R test harness are
original zukzeit work.

Checkpoint weights
------------------

Checkpoint weights are not included in this package. When explicitly requested
by a user they are downloaded from their upstream repository and remain subject
to the licence reported by zuk_models(), currently Apache-2.0 for TimesFM 2.5.
